sequenceDiagram
    participant R1 as Request 1
    participant R2 as Request 2
    participant Auth as TokenAuthenticator
    participant Store as TokenStore
    participant Srv as Backend

    R1->>Srv: GET with access v5
    R2->>Srv: GET with access v5
    Srv-->>R1: 401
    Srv-->>R2: 401
    R1->>Auth: authenticate (saw v5)
    R2->>Auth: authenticate (saw v5)
    Auth->>Store: lock mutex (R1 wins)
    Auth->>Store: version still v5? yes
    Auth->>Srv: POST /token/refresh
    Srv-->>Auth: new access+refresh v6 (rotated)
    Auth->>Store: update to v6, unlock
    Auth-->>R1: retry with v6
    R2->>Store: lock mutex, version now v6 != v5
    Auth-->>R2: reuse v6, no refresh
    R1->>Srv: retry OK
    R2->>Srv: retry OK
